<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Toll Holdings half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Toll Holdings half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     6.74 vs 3.39</p>
<p>    Net					6.08 vs 2.62</p>
<p>    Sales				  247.97 vs 107.37</p>
<p>    Other income			   9.77 vs 2.61</p>
<p>    Dividend				 6.0  vs 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Toll Holdings Ltd is a transport company. It acquired the Australian general transport and freight operations of Brambles Industries Ltd in June last year.</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
</text>
